#NEXUS

[ vickaryous2002a_fig1: Ankylosaur cladogram. The numbered circles 1-4 are keys, not printed names, so no internal labels are encoded. One three-way node: Saichania, Pinacosaurus and Tarchia, stem entering at Pinacosaurus' height. Several stems enter their nodes away from the middle (node 3's stem enters the Gobisaurus line; nodes 1-3 sit on one vertical); each is read by where the horizontal lines meet. 12 tips, 1 polytomies (3 children). Sample 4 case (census 2, seed 20261201). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=12;
    TAXLABELS
        Lesothosaurus
        Huayangosaurus
        Edmontonia
        Pawpawsaurus
        Gargoyleosaurus
        Gobisaurus
        Euoplocephalus
        Ankylosaurus
        Saichania
        Pinacosaurus
        Tarchia
        Tsagantegia
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE vickaryous2002a_fig1 = [&R] (Lesothosaurus,(Huayangosaurus,((Edmontonia,Pawpawsaurus),(Gargoyleosaurus,(Gobisaurus,((Euoplocephalus,Ankylosaurus),((Saichania,Pinacosaurus,Tarchia),Tsagantegia)))))));
END;
